{"id":"torno","lemma":"torno","pos":"noun","rank":4276,"glosses":["lathe","winch"],"ipa":"/ˈtoɾno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tornos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-torno.wav","examples":[{"text":"No todo gira en torno a ti.","en":"It's not always about you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611317","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"tour"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]},{"text":"Corrimos en torno al parque.","en":"We ran around the park.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461754","words":[{"g":"to run, to jog","l":"correr"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"park"}]},{"text":"El mundo no gira en torno tuyo.","en":"The world doesn't revolve around you.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"world, earth"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"tour"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"yours"}]},{"text":"El número real es en torno al doble de eso.","en":"The actual number is about double that.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"in / on"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"real number"],[6,8,"doubly"]]},{"text":"Llegaré allí en torno a las dos y media.","en":"I'll get there at about 2:30.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302886","words":[{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"half"}]}]}